WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.269 --> 00:00:05.442
Pick a layout from the palette, like Part-part-whole.

2
00:00:05.442 --> 00:00:08.261
Today’s task: a pizza of 8 slices, and 3 are eaten.

3
00:00:08.261 --> 00:00:11.931
Type in a part to give it a name.

4
00:00:11.931 --> 00:00:15.151
Use − and + to change the size of a part.

5
00:00:15.151 --> 00:00:17.961
3 of 8 slices are eaten, so 5/8 of the pizza is left.

6
00:00:17.961 --> 00:00:21.679
Add a part or a new bar from the palette.

7
00:00:21.679 --> 00:00:25.397
A bar model starts locked. Hold its handle to unlock it.

8
00:00:25.397 --> 00:00:27.513
Then drag the handle to move it.

9
00:00:27.513 --> 00:00:32.142
Totals off hides the total on the handle.

10
00:00:32.142 --> 00:00:40.108
Every task has its prompt and a teacher note, below the board.
